Minhaajulhudaa is a Multi platform organization that have a Masjid, School, Charity Organization and Travels and Tours company each of this platform should have a features rich dedicated platform's apps inside same codebase with a dedicated sub directory slug / and one platform should not affect the other atall with proper maintainability for each platform. 


Also, though so many foundation have been laid but there are so many features of all the platforms that have not been implemented to ensure the platforms are production ready, you need to audit the current state and complete the platform fully. Below is the original specs for your reference;  

